      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Noticed this with one of my avis when trying to recreate this bug after Wing pointed it out to me. This was the only avi I have that I could recreate the bug with. Specifically, zooming in and out in the accessories view causes the cap on the flare attached to the back of the avatar to move unexpectedly.\n\nMy hypothesis is that there's likely some weird interaction w/ either Constraints or Physbones and the accessories view which could be causing it as those are the only two things that should be affecting that cap.\n\nAvatar ID: avtr_7c80a2a5-3473-421f-86ce-fdda8fa8eb3f",
